{"content":[{"c":["EPHAH (P",{"c":["erson"],"sourceClass":"lc","t":"span"},")"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Son of Midian, an offspring of Abraham through his concubine Keturah (",{"href":"?bref=Gen.25.4","r":"Gen.25.4","rawR":"Gen.25.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Gen.25.4","value":"Gen.25.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"Gn 25:4"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.1.33","r":"1Chr.1.33","rawR":"1Chr.1.33","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.1.33","value":"1Chr.1.33"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 1:33"},"). Isaiah mentions him as a gold trader (",{"href":"?bref=Isa.60.6","r":"Isa.60.6","rawR":"Isa.60.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.60.6","value":"Isa.60.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"Is 60:6"},"). Some manuscripts mention two sons of Midian with the same name, Ephah, but that is an error of misspelling."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Caleb’s concubine, who bore him three sons (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.2.46","r":"1Chr.2.46","rawR":"1Chr.2.46","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.2.46","value":"1Chr.2.46"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 2:46"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Jahdai’s son from Judah’s tribe (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.2.47","r":"1Chr.2.47","rawR":"1Chr.2.47","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.2.47","value":"1Chr.2.47"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 2:47"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"EphahPerson","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Gn 25:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Gen.25.4","rawQueryValue":"Gen.25.4","sourceRefExact":"Gen.25.4"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 1:33","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.1.33","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.1.33","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.1.33"},{"anchorText":"Is 60:6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.60.6","rawQueryValue":"Isa.60.6","sourceRefExact":"Isa.60.6"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 2:46","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.2.46","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.2.46","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.2.46"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 2:47","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.2.47","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.2.47","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.2.47"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"8d08cb469b665da586abef3f831adf07e7511549d7ff9d2553ba0f4fe0867b10","sourceItemName":"EphahPerson","sourceItemOrder":191,"sourceMember":"Articles/E.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"EphahPerson","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Ephah (Person)","title":"Ephah (Person)","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}